<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Cahaya Kalbar 1996 net jumps.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Cahaya Kalbar 1996 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's specialty fats and cocoa grinding firm Cahaya Kalbar said on Monday it posted a net profit of 17 billion rupiah in 1996 against 6.6 billion rupiah in 1995.  </p>
<p>&quot;This net profit was higher than the revised projection of 16.8 billion rupiah,&quot; the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cahaya Kalbar also said it had bought two coastal tanker vessels for $2.0 million to transport its own raw materials and finished goods.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
